faillir        verb class=irr pres=faillis,faillissons,faillissent ps=faillis fut=faillirai pp=failli conf=90 note=mostly infinitive, passé simple and passé composé (j'ai failli tomber); archaic je faux, ils faillent not generated
faire          verb class=faire
falloir        verb class=irr impersonal pres=-,-,faut,-,-,- ps=fallus fut=faudrai subj=faille impf=fallais pp=fallu pp_inv ppr=- note=impersonal: only il faut …
